{"timestamp": 1783625762.3784, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 13, "data": {"caller": "player_5", "reason": "Frank reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "medbay", "victim_name": "Charlie"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1783625762.379904, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 13, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1783625769.33149, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I reported Charlie\u2019s body in medbay. My route this round was storage \u2192 lower_engine \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 medbay. When I got to medbay, I saw Alice there around tick 13, and Charlie\u2019s body was in medbay too. I don\u2019t know if Alice killed or just arrived before me, but she was the only person I saw near the body."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625776.713728, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I went electrical \u2192 medbay \u2192 upper_engine \u2192 oxygen. I didn\u2019t encounter anyone at all on that route, and when I passed through medbay I didn\u2019t see Alice, Frank, or Charlie\u2019s body. So if Frank found the body there with Alice around tick 13, then the kill likely happened after I left medbay. That does put Alice as the only person currently placed near the body, but I\u2019d like to hear her route and timing before voting."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625787.387845, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My route was security \u2192 navigation \u2192 back to security \u2192 electrical. I saw Alice in security around tick 8, then Bob in electrical around tick 10, and then I saw Alice enter electrical from security at tick 12.\n\nSo Frank saying Alice was in medbay around tick 13 is a little weird to me \u2014 unless the timing is off or she moved really fast, that doesn\u2019t fully line up with what I saw. I never saw Charlie or the body. I\u2019d like to hear Alice explain her route, and Frank maybe clarify exactly when he saw her in medbay."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625803.5405152, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I was upper_engine \u2192 oxygen \u2192 back through upper_engine \u2192 medbay \u2192 electrical \u2192 cafeteria. I did pass medbay and saw Charlie alive there around tick 8, but I didn\u2019t see a body then and I left pretty quickly toward electrical.\n\nAt electrical around tick 10 I saw Eve come in from security, so that part matches what Eve said about seeing me there. If Eve then saw Alice enter electrical from security at tick 12, Frank seeing Alice in medbay at tick 13 sounds really tight timing-wise. Not impossible depending on paths, but weird.\n\nSo from my POV Charlie died after I left medbay, and I\u2019d like Alice to explain her route. But Frank\u2019s timing/claim also needs clarification because Eve\u2019s info makes Alice being in medbay that fast questionable."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625836.0077949, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "My route was cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. I never went to medbay this round.\n\nI saw Eve enter security from navigation around tick 8, and I was still on the security/electrical side. Then I went into electrical, and Eve saw me there around tick 12 \u2014 I also saw Eve there. So Frank saying he saw me in medbay at tick 13 does not line up with my route at all.\n\nBob\u2019s info says Charlie was alive in medbay around tick 8, and Diana says she passed medbay earlier and saw no body. That means the kill happened after Bob left, but I was accounted for on the opposite side by Eve around tick 12.\n\nTo me the biggest contradiction is Frank placing me at the body when I was in electrical. Either Frank badly misidentified someone, or he\u2019s lying and trying to frame me off a self-report. Since he\u2019s the reporter and his story directly contradicts both Eve\u2019s and my position, I think Frank is the most suspicious here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625853.925648, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I want to clarify: I reported immediately when I entered medbay and saw Charlie\u2019s body. Alice was in medbay with the body when I got there \u2014 that\u2019s the key thing I\u2019m saying. My timing was around tick 13, but if I\u2019m off by a tick, the important part is still that I saw Alice in the room with Charlie dead.\n\nDiana and Bob both make it sound like Charlie died after they passed through medbay, so the window is pretty narrow. I understand Eve says she saw Alice in electrical around tick 12, but from my POV that directly conflicts with what I saw in medbay.\n\nI\u2019m not trying to frame anyone \u2014 I\u2019m the one who found and reported. Alice was the only person I saw near the body. I think Alice needs to be the vote unless people are convinced Eve\u2019s timing makes that impossible."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625870.193216, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I\u2019m leaning Frank here. With only one Duck, Alice and Eve can\u2019t be teaming as Ducks, and Eve\u2019s account independently places Alice on the security/electrical side around tick 12. Bob also confirms seeing Eve in electrical around tick 10, which makes Eve\u2019s route more believable.\n\nMy own info is just that I passed through medbay earlier and saw no one and no body, so Charlie died after I left and likely after Bob saw Charlie alive around tick 8. But Frank\u2019s accusation depends on Alice being in medbay with the body, and that directly clashes with Alice and Eve both placing Alice in electrical shortly before the report.\n\nUnless there\u2019s some huge timing mistake or misidentification, Frank\u2019s story feels like the one that doesn\u2019t fit. A self-report frame on Alice makes sense to me."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625880.0698712, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "I still think Frank is the bad story here.\n\nTo restate my info: I was security \u2192 navigation \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. I saw Alice in security around tick 8, Bob in electrical around tick 10, and then I specifically saw Alice enter electrical from security at tick 12. Alice\u2019s route matches what I saw, and Bob seeing me in electrical supports my timing too.\n\nFor Frank\u2019s version to be true, Alice would have had to be in electrical with me at tick 12 and then somehow be in medbay with the body basically immediately after. That feels way less believable than Frank self-reporting and falsely placing Alice there.\n\nSince there\u2019s only one Duck, Alice and I can\u2019t be partners covering each other. I\u2019m voting Frank unless someone has something major that changes this."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625898.5743449, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "Yeah, after hearing everyone again, I\u2019m leaning Frank too.\n\nMy only hard info is: I saw Charlie alive in medbay around tick 8, then I went toward electrical and saw Eve there around tick 10 coming from security. So Eve\u2019s timing is pretty anchored from my POV. If she then saw Alice enter electrical from security around tick 12, Frank saying Alice was in medbay with the body basically right after that feels really hard to make work.\n\nI didn\u2019t see Alice in medbay when I passed, and Alice\u2019s route matches Eve\u2019s info. Since there\u2019s only one Duck, Eve can\u2019t be covering for Alice as a partner. So unless Frank made a huge mistaken ID, his story is the one that doesn\u2019t fit.\n\nI think Frank is probably the vote here."}}
{"timestamp": 1783625907.785697, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 13, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019m still on Frank here.\n\nMy route never touched medbay: cafeteria \u2192 weapons \u2192 security \u2192 electrical. I saw Eve in security around tick 8 when she came in from navigation, and then I saw her again in electrical around tick 12. Eve also saw me enter electrical from security at that same time, so my position is backed up by someone else.\n\nBob confirms Eve\u2019s timing too because he saw her in electrical around tick 10, so Eve\u2019s account isn\u2019t just random. With only one Duck, Eve and I can\u2019t be a Duck pair covering each other.\n\nFrank\u2019s whole case is that he saw me in medbay with Charlie\u2019s body, but that directly conflicts with multiple people\u2019s timing. I think he self-reported and tried to pin it on me because I wasn\u2019t there to immediately contradict him at the body.\n\nI\u2019m voting Frank."}}
